<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela December inflation seen at 2 pct - Casas.</title>
<headline>Venezuela December inflation seen at 2 pct - Casas.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venezuelan inflation in December will be around two percent, Central Bank Governor Antonio Casas Gonzalez said, confirming the steady decline in recent months.</p>
<p>&quot;Inflation at the end of the year is expected to be around two percent,&quot; Casas said at a presentation to the Senate Finance Committee.</p>
</text>
